{
  "metadata": { "name": "Bonds", "language_info": { "name": "JavaScipt", "version": "8.0" } },
  "jsnbversion": "v0.1",
  "cells": [
    { "code": "# Voltrix Tests — `/bonds`\n", "status": "", "output": "<h1>Voltrix Tests — <code>/bonds</code></h1>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const BASE = 'http://localhost:8000/v2';\n\nasync function post(path, body) {\n  const res = await fetch(`${BASE}${path}`, {\n    method: 'POST',\n    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n    body: JSON.stringify(body),\n  });\n  return res.json();\n}", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 1. Bond Pricing — Interactive\n\nCompute dirty price, accrued interest, and clean price from a yield-to-maturity.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>1. Bond Pricing — Interactive</h2>\n<p>Compute dirty price, accrued interest, and clean price from a yield-to-maturity.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='bp-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Maturity Date <input id='bp-mat' type='date' value='2030-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Coupon Rate <input id='bp-cpn' type='number' value='0.05' step='0.005'></label>\n  <label>Face Value <input id='bp-face' type='number' value='1000'></label>\n  <label>Frequency <select id='bp-freq'><option value='semi_annual'>semi_annual</option><option value='annual'>annual</option><option value='quarterly'>quarterly</option><option value='monthly'>monthly</option></select></label>\n  <label>YTM <input id='bp-ytm' type='number' value='0.045' step='0.005'></label>\n  <label>Day Count <select id='bp-dc'><option value='30/360'>30/360</option><option value='ACT/365'>ACT/365</option><option value='ACT/360'>ACT/360</option><option value='ACT/ACT'>ACT/ACT</option></select></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/bonds/price', {\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('bp-settle').value,\n  maturity_date:   document.getElementById('bp-mat').value,\n  coupon_rate:     parseFloat(document.getElementById('bp-cpn').value),\n  face_value:      parseFloat(document.getElementById('bp-face').value),\n  frequency:       document.getElementById('bp-freq').value,\n  ytm:             parseFloat(document.getElementById('bp-ytm').value),\n  day_count:       document.getElementById('bp-dc').value,\n});\nscrib.show('Dirty Price (Full):  ' + result.price);\nscrib.show('Accrued Interest:    ' + result.accrued_interest);\nscrib.show('Clean Price:         ' + result.clean_price);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 2. Yield-to-Maturity Solver\n\nBack-solve for the YTM that matches an observed clean market price.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>2. Yield-to-Maturity Solver</h2>\n<p>Back-solve for the YTM that matches an observed clean market price.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Clean Price <input id='by-price' type='number' value='1013.1' step='0.1'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='by-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Maturity Date <input id='by-mat' type='date' value='2030-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Coupon Rate <input id='by-cpn' type='number' value='0.05' step='0.005'></label>\n  <label>Face Value <input id='by-face' type='number' value='1000'></label>\n  <label>Frequency <select id='by-freq'><option value='semi_annual'>semi_annual</option><option value='annual'>annual</option></select></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/bonds/yield', {\n  clean_price:     parseFloat(document.getElementById('by-price').value),\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('by-settle').value,\n  maturity_date:   document.getElementById('by-mat').value,\n  coupon_rate:     parseFloat(document.getElementById('by-cpn').value),\n  face_value:      parseFloat(document.getElementById('by-face').value),\n  frequency:       document.getElementById('by-freq').value,\n});\nscrib.show('YTM:        ' + (result.ytm * 100).toFixed(4) + '%');\nscrib.show('Iterations: ' + result.iterations);\nscrib.show('Status:     ' + result.status);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 3. Duration & Convexity\n\nMacaulay duration, modified duration, and convexity from clean price and YTM.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>3. Duration &amp; Convexity</h2>\n<p>Macaulay duration, modified duration, and convexity from clean price and YTM.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Clean Price <input id='bs-price' type='number' value='1013.1' step='0.1'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='bs-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Maturity Date <input id='bs-mat' type='date' value='2030-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Coupon Rate <input id='bs-cpn' type='number' value='0.05' step='0.005'></label>\n  <label>Face Value <input id='bs-face' type='number' value='1000'></label>\n  <label>Frequency <select id='bs-freq'><option value='semi_annual'>semi_annual</option><option value='annual'>annual</option></select></label>\n  <label>YTM <input id='bs-ytm' type='number' value='0.045' step='0.005'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/bonds/sensitivity', {\n  clean_price:     parseFloat(document.getElementById('bs-price').value),\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('bs-settle').value,\n  maturity_date:   document.getElementById('bs-mat').value,\n  coupon_rate:     parseFloat(document.getElementById('bs-cpn').value),\n  face_value:      parseFloat(document.getElementById('bs-face').value),\n  frequency:       document.getElementById('bs-freq').value,\n  ytm:             parseFloat(document.getElementById('bs-ytm').value),\n});\nscrib.show('Macaulay Duration:  ' + result.duration + ' years');\nscrib.show('Modified Duration:  ' + result.modified_duration);\nscrib.show('Convexity:          ' + result.convexity);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 4. Round-Trip: Price → Yield → Price\n\nPrice a bond at a given YTM, recover the YTM from the clean price, then reprice. All three should match.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>4. Round-Trip: Price → Yield → Price</h2>\n<p>Price a bond at a given YTM, recover the YTM from the clean price, then reprice. All three should match.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const INPUT_YTM = 0.045;\nconst BOND = {\n  settlement_date: '2026-01-01', maturity_date: '2030-01-01',\n  coupon_rate: 0.05, face_value: 1000, frequency: 'semi_annual', day_count: '30/360',\n};\n\nconst priced = await post('/bonds/price', { ...BOND, ytm: INPUT_YTM });\nconst solved = await post('/bonds/yield',  { ...BOND, clean_price: priced.clean_price });\nconst repriced = await post('/bonds/price', { ...BOND, ytm: solved.ytm });\n\nscrib.show('Input YTM:         ' + INPUT_YTM);\nscrib.show('Clean Price:       ' + priced.clean_price);\nscrib.show('Recovered YTM:     ' + solved.ytm.toFixed(8));\nscrib.show('YTM match:         ' + (Math.abs(solved.ytm - INPUT_YTM) < 1e-6));\nscrib.show('Repriced clean:    ' + repriced.clean_price);\nscrib.show('Price match:       ' + (Math.abs(repriced.clean_price - priced.clean_price) < 0.001));", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 5. Yield Effect on Price\n\nSweep YTM from 2% to 8% and observe the price-yield relationship.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>5. Yield Effect on Price</h2>\n<p>Sweep YTM from 2% to 8% and observe the price-yield relationship.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const BOND2 = {\n  settlement_date: '2026-01-01', maturity_date: '2031-01-01',\n  coupon_rate: 0.05, face_value: 1000, frequency: 'semi_annual', day_count: '30/360',\n};\nconst ytms = [0.02, 0.03, 0.04, 0.045, 0.05, 0.055, 0.06, 0.07, 0.08];\nconst results = await Promise.all(ytms.map(y => post('/bonds/price', { ...BOND2, ytm: y })));\nscrib.show('YTM    | Clean Price | Dirty Price | Δ from par');\nytms.forEach((y, i) => {\n  const delta = (results[i].clean_price - 1000).toFixed(2);\n  scrib.show((y*100).toFixed(1) + '%  | ' + results[i].clean_price.toFixed(2).padStart(10) + ' | ' + results[i].price.toFixed(2).padStart(10) + ' | ' + (delta > 0 ? '+' : '') + delta);\n});", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" }
  ],
  "source": "https://github.com/gopi-suvanam/scribbler",
  "run_on_load": false
}
